            <ArticleTitle>Bronchial thermoplasty: a new treatment for severe refractory asthma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>477-85</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3949/ccjm.78a.10185</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Bronchial thermoplasty was recently approved for treating severe refractory asthma that is not well controlled by high-dose inhaled corticosteroids and long-acting bronchodilator therapy. This article reviews its indications, evidence of efficacy, and protocols.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
